        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truco Bar is a unique digital experience that brings the lively atmosphere of classic Brazilian &quot;botecos&quot; (local bars) into the world of gaming. Inspired by Brazilian popular culture, this Truco Paulista card game lets you play matches with 2 or 4 players, whether with friends or strangers online. <br><br>Sit at the table, crack open an imaginary cold one, and get ready to shout “TRUCO!” in the heat of the moment. Bluff, raise the stakes, call six, nine, or twelve and don’t forget the iconic “é o zap!”. But it’s not just about the cards the laid back environment, bar inspired soundtrack, and in-game chat turn every match into a true hangout. <br><br>Truco Bar is more than just a card game, it’s a tribute to street smarts, friendship, and the good old chaos of a bar table. Whether you're a bluffing pro or a curious newcomer, the table’s set. All that's missing is you.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truco Bar is a unique digital experience that brings the lively atmosphere of classic Brazilian &quot;botecos&quot; (local bars) into the world of gaming. Inspired by Brazilian popular culture, this Truco Paulista card game lets you play matches with 2 or 4 players, whether with friends or strangers online. <br><br>Sit at the table, crack open an imaginary cold one, and get ready to shout “TRUCO!” in the heat of the moment. Bluff, raise the stakes, call six, nine, or twelve and don’t forget the iconic “é o zap!”. But it’s not just about the cards the laid back environment, bar inspired soundtrack, and in-game chat turn every match into a true hangout. <br><br>Truco Bar is more than just a card game, it’s a tribute to street smarts, friendship, and the good old chaos of a bar table. Whether you're a bluffing pro or a curious newcomer, the table’s set. All that's missing is you.</p>",
        "short_description": "Truco Bar is a digital card game for 2 or 4 players in a classic Brazilian Pub. This card game is very famous in Brazil and played by people of all ages and in a lot different places, mainly in pubs. Play with your friends, &quot;truque&quot;, raise the stakes, have a nice chat, bluff and mainly: HAVE FUN!",
